   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🎉 Congratulations! You Built Your First Circuit!\n",
    "\n",
    "### What You Just Accomplished:\n",
    "\n",
    "✅ **Built a circuit** using simulation tools  \n",
    "✅ **Ran DC analysis** to get voltages and currents  \n",
    "✅ **Verified your prediction** - Point A is indeed 9V!  \n",
    "✅ **Explored interactively** how changing components affects the circuit  \n",
    "\n",
    "### Key Discoveries:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Voltage at connection points** doesn't change with resistance\n",
    "2. **Current through the circuit** follows Ohm's law: I = V/R\n",
    "3. **Power dissipation** increases with current: P = V × I\n",
    "4. **Simulation matches theory** - our tools work!\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Ready for a Challenge?\n",
    "\n",
    "Now that you understand the basics, let's tackle a slightly more complex problem where you'll apply Ohm's law independently!\n",
