    "\n",
    "### Reflection Questions:\n",
    "\n",
    "Before moving on, make sure you can answer:\n",
    "1. Why is the voltage at Point A always 9V regardless of resistor value?\n",
    "2. What happens to current when you increase the resistance?\n",
    "3. How do you calculate power dissipated in a resistor?\n",
    "\n",
    "*If any of these are unclear, review the interactive exploration above!*"
